  "markup": "\u003Ch2\u003EJoin the Umbraco community\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EUmbraco is known for its welcoming community, and newcomers are always made to feel at home. Ask a question on the \u003Ca href=\u0022https://forum.umbraco.com/\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener\u0022\u003EUmbraco Forum\u003C/a\u003E, chat with other developers on the \u003Ca href=\u0022https://discord.umbraco.com/\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener\u0022\u003EUmbraco Discord\u003C/a\u003E, or find a meetup near you.\u003C/p\u003E"
}]]></Value>
